Z||000002||btoth||12-11-2001||11:32 AM||||I've got the best results from just normal AC Delco plugs.<P>A friend of mine tried the Bosch +4 in his '85 GT and it ran like crap.  Replaced them with generic plugs and it ran just fine.  Maybe it had something to do with the gapping on the +4's.<P>Do a search for spark plugs and you'll find some interesting threads on the subject.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||84Bill||12-11-2001||12:19 PM||||I hear champions do a good job  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>But seriously any plug will do I switch back to A/C myself.||||reg||1
